NewBarkTown_Lab_Text_ElmChooseAPokemon:
	.string "我希望你能从这只盒子里\n挑一只宝可梦来培养。\p你将成为那只宝可梦的\n第一个搭档，{PLAYER}！\p来吧，选一只！$"
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""
	.string ""

NewBarkTown_Lab_Text_ElmWhereGoing:
